MAPS, ZIP CODES AND NEIGHBORHOOD PAGES

City of Detroit open data (data.detroitmi.gov):
  Roads, city parks, the city boundary, ZIP code areas, neighborhoods
  Joe Louis Greenway route segments and study area
  Assessor: property sales, parcels
  Buildings, Safety Engineering and Environmental Department (BSEED): building
    permits, active rental certificates of compliance, vacant property registrations
  Blight tickets; completed demolitions
  Improve Detroit: issues people reported to the City
  Detroit Fire Department: fire incidents
  Stores that take SNAP (Bridge card)
  Street pavement ratings
  Detroit Department of Transportation (DDOT): bus stops

US Census Bureau (TIGER/Line and TIGERweb; public domain):
  Outlines of Detroit, Hamtramck, Highland Park and Dearborn
  Streets in Hamtramck, Highland Park and Dearborn
  ZIP Code Tabulation Areas for Dearborn ZIP codes


